        "text": "According to Robert Digges, Jr., according to Robert Digges, Jr., according to Robert Digges, Jr., the case challenges Michigan\u2019s $100 per\u2011truck flat annual fee imposed on trucks registered for point\u2011to\u2011point operations in Michigan."
      },
