            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Robert Digges, Jr., according to Robert Digges, Jr., according to Robert Digges, Jr., petitioners argue that the fee has the same impermissible effects on interstate commerce as the flat truck fees struck down in American Trucking Associations v. Scheiner."
