              "pages": {
                "end": 20,
                "start": 20
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Hanson, petitioners assert that a $90 plating fee plus a $10 registration fee would be permissible because the registration fee is part of the interstate qualification process."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Hanson",
          "citations": [
