              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 21,
                "start": 21
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Hanson, petitioners maintain that even a $20 fee with $80 toward IRP would still violate the SSRS if part of the registration process."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Boynton",
          "citations": [
