              "pages": {
                "end": 24,
                "start": 24
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Boynton, petitioners claim the intrastate fee places significant burdens on interstate commerce and that the Michigan Court of Appeals rejected this claim as speculation."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Digges",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "8e8999892c840aa5892c4fa25de9b90ef9e7cb2289a2716dbd6d70a0fb8ad52d",
